    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3094" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpostăto</span></b> ,
			āre, v. n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστατέω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to forsake one's religion</i>, <i>to apostatize</i> (eccl. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">apostatare a Deo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Eccli. 10, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">apostatare faciunt sapientes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. ib. 19, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cypr. Ep. 1, 2</span></i>. </div>
